1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,750
NARRATOR: You're the last astronaut awake. And your ship is dying.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,750
NARRATOR: Earth hasn't responded in forty-seven days.

3
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,650
NARRATOR: And navigation just failed.

4
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:14,050
WANGDOO: Captain! Good news!

5
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:16,850
WANGDOO: I fixed the coffee machine!

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:19,900
WANGDOO: Bad news. Everything else is broken.

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,400
WANGDOO: Hold that cable. I'll take the switch.

8
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:28,750
WANGDOO: Navigation restored! Mostly.

9
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:32,900
NARRATOR: Two signals. Two possible ways to survive.

10
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,350
WANGDOO: That one looks fun!

11
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:37,500
WANGDOO: Probably.

12
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:43,650
WANGDOO: One jump. No return trip. Pick wisely.

13
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:49,150
NARRATOR: Where should we go?

14
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:57,900
NARRATOR: Your choices shape their story. Build your own journey with AltWing.
